<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Make a gourmet cocktail, where every factor from temperature of glass, choice of stirring instrument and type of garnish has been precisely calculated for the maximum flavor and body possible.-->
  <VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.description>制作美味的鸡尾酒，其中从玻璃杯的温度、搅拌工具的选择和装饰类型的每个因素都经过精确计算，以尽可能获得最大的风味和口感。</VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.description>
  <!--EN: simple spirits-->
  <VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.ingredients.0.filter.customSummary>简单的精神</VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.ingredients.0.filter.customSummary>
  <!--EN: luxury spirits-->
  <VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.ingredients.1.filter.customSummary>奢侈烈酒</VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.ingredients.1.filter.customSummary>
  <!--EN: non-alcoholic drinks-->
  <VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.ingredients.2.filter.customSummary>非酒精饮料</VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.ingredients.2.filter.customSummary>
  <!--EN: condiments-->
  <VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.ingredients.3.filter.customSummary>调味品</VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.ingredients.3.filter.customSummary>
  <!--EN: Making gourmet cocktail.-->
  <VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.jobString>制作美食鸡尾酒。</VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.jobString>
  <!--EN: make gourmet cocktail-->
  <VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.label>制作美食鸡尾酒</VBE_MakeCocktailGourmet.label>
  <!--EN: Make a gelatinized cube of Go-Juice, able to be digested rather than injected. While it can be used in any meal, it is often melted into soups or used as a thickening agent in cocktails.-->
  <VBE_MakeGoJuiceStock.description>制作一块糊化的 Go-Juice 立方体，可以消化而不是注射。虽然它可以用于任何餐食，但它经常被融化到汤中或用作鸡尾酒中的增稠剂。</VBE_MakeGoJuiceStock.description>
  <!--EN: Making go-juice stock.-->
  <VBE_MakeGoJuiceStock.jobString>制作果汁高汤。</VBE_MakeGoJuiceStock.jobString>
  <!--EN: make go-juice stock-->
  <VBE_MakeGoJuiceStock.label>制作果汁高汤</VBE_MakeGoJuiceStock.label>
  <!--EN: Make a very finely blended powder made from luciferium. Usually put around rims of alcoholic drinks in bars frequented by the wealthy and powerful.-->
  <VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.description>制作由荧光素制成的非常精细的混合粉末。通常在富人和权贵经常光顾的酒吧里放置在酒精饮料的边缘。</VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.description>
  <!--EN: Making luciferium powder.-->
  <VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.jobString>制作荧光粉。</VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.jobString>
  <!--EN: make luciferium powder-->
  <VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.label>制作荧光粉</VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.label>
  <!--EN: Make soda syrup by mixing natural fruit juice with sugar. This recipe is much more efficient.-->
  <VBE_MakeSodaSyrupBulk.description>将天然果汁与糖混合制成苏打糖浆。这个食谱更有效。</VBE_MakeSodaSyrupBulk.description>
  <!--EN: Making soda syrup.-->
  <VBE_MakeSodaSyrupBulk.jobString>制作苏打糖浆。</VBE_MakeSodaSyrupBulk.jobString>
  <!--EN: make soda syrup (efficient)-->
  <VBE_MakeSodaSyrupBulk.label>制作苏打糖浆（高效）</VBE_MakeSodaSyrupBulk.label>
  <!--EN: Make a crushed and powdered form of wake-up, surprisingly sweet and sometimes used as a replacement for sugar in desserts or dissolved into a morning espresso.-->
  <VBE_MakeWakeUpPowder.description>制成压碎的粉末状醒酒剂，甜度惊人，有时用作甜点中糖的替代品或溶解在早晨的浓缩咖啡中。</VBE_MakeWakeUpPowder.description>
  <!--EN: Making wake-up powder.-->
  <VBE_MakeWakeUpPowder.jobString>制作醒神粉。</VBE_MakeWakeUpPowder.jobString>
  <!--EN: make wake-up powder-->
  <VBE_MakeWakeUpPowder.label>制作唤醒粉</VBE_MakeWakeUpPowder.label>
  <!--EN: Make a starchy and mostly liquid mixture with pulpy chunks strewn throughout. Ready To be aged.-->
  <VBE_MakeWhiskeyMashFromFlour.description>制作淀粉质且大部分为液体的混合物，并撒上果肉块。准备好变老了。</VBE_MakeWhiskeyMashFromFlour.description>
  <!--EN: Making whiskey mash.-->
  <VBE_MakeWhiskeyMashFromFlour.jobString>制作威士忌泥。</VBE_MakeWhiskeyMashFromFlour.jobString>
  <!--EN: make whiskey mash from flour-->
  <VBE_MakeWhiskeyMashFromFlour.label>用面粉制作威士忌泥</VBE_MakeWhiskeyMashFromFlour.label>
</LanguageData>
